      "description": "An essential tool for Previs and Layout Artists, Animators and any 3D Artist that needs to animate a camera. Move your device in any direction, VirtuCamera will capture the motion and instantly send it over Wi-Fi to the camera in your favorite DCC.\n\n- Live Viewport Streaming\nSee your scene through the App in real time. VirtuCamera streams the viewport over Wi-Fi so you don’t miss any detail.\n\n- Control the scene from the App\nControl the playback, choose from your scene cameras, animate the focal length or scale camera movements to travel long distances.\n\n- Up to 60 FPS\nDevice motion and viewport streaming are captured and sent at up to 60 frames per second. You can configure this parameter at your needs.\n\n- Camera Smoothing\nRemove unwanted hand noise and create smooth camera animations.\n\n- Encrypted Connection\nEnsures modern, industry-standard encryption for maximum protection. Keeps your video streams fully private between the server (DCC plugin), and app. Specially created for Movies, Series, Games and any other IP protected project. Because your privacy is important to us.\n\n- New Pro features! - on Screen joysticks, support for bluetooth gamepads, slider presets, custom scripts, custom sliders, dolly zoom mode, extra camera controls and rule of thirds grid overlay.\n\nThis app requires an external 3D content creation software to work, please take a look at the following minimum system requirements:\n- A computer powerful enough to play your 3D scenes.\n- A recent version of Windows®, MacOS® or Linux® operating system.\n- A stable network connection.\n- The latest version of the plug-in provided in our webpage.\n- One of the following DCC softwares:\nBlender®: 4.5 LTS, 5.0, 5.1, 5.2 LTS\nAutodesk® Maya®: 2026, 2027\nSideFX® Houdini®: 20.5(QT6), 21.0, 22.0\nMaxon® Cinema4D®: 2026\nAutodesk® 3dsMax®: 2026, 2027\nFoundry® Nuke®: 16, 17\n\nHere you can find the installation guide for the plugin:\nhttps://virtucamera.com/how-tos/\n\nTerms And Conditions:\nhttps://virtucamera.com/terms-and-conditions",
